  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot halfway with water, cover, and bring to a boil. Uncover, add salt and pasta, and stir for a few seconds. Cook until desired firmness, 8-10 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel and mince garlic. In a medium bowl, prepare sauce by whisking together garlic, water, peanut butter, vinegar, soy sauce, honey, oil, and pepper."
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss broccoli slaw into a large bowl. Wash and dry cilantro. Shave leaves off the stems; discard the stems and mince the leaves. Add to bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and cut lime into wedges. Roughly chop peanuts."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain pasta in a colander and rinse under cold water. Shake to drain excess liquid, then add to bowl with broccoli slaw."
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour peanut sauce over top and toss to coat."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, place noodles in a bowl and garnish with peanuts and lime wedges. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
